# The Odin toolchain Larva builds and is reviewed against — the one source of truth.
# CI (.github/actions/setup-odin), `make env`, `make sdk-diff` and the reuse scout
# all read this file. Bump it in its own PR, with `make sdk-diff TO=<new commit>` in
# the body: that report lists the SDK additions the bump makes available and the
# signature changes it may break.
#
# commit   exact odin-lang/Odin commit (40 hex); the SDK source agents read is this tree.
# release  prebuilt GitHub release built from `commit`, or empty to build from source.
# llvm     LLVM major the compiler is built/linked with.
commit=dd407c60af028634ba3dff102308f08616022e83
release=
llvm=18
